---
description: TaskHub Project Health Check Protocol
alwaysApply: true
---

Before and after code changes, run the following:
1. Install all dependencies (`pnpm install --frozen-lockfile`).
2. Clean backend artifacts (`dotnet clean`).
3. Enforce code style (`dotnet format`, `pnpm lint`).
4. Build and typecheck all code (`pnpm build`, `dotnet build`).
5. Run all tests (`dotnet test`, `pnpm test:run`).
6. Scan for vulnerabilities (`dotnet list package --vulnerable`, `pnpm audit`).
7. Check for pending EF Core migrations.
On any failure: STOP, log the error, analyze, fix, and re-run the health check.